  'Optional choices to show the user. If you recommend one, put it first and append "(Recommended)" to that label.': '可选的要展示给用户的选项。如果你推荐其中一个，请把它放在首位，并在该标签后追加 "(Recommended)"。',
  'Short user-facing option label.': '简短的面向用户的选项标签。',
